(7265150, 1130300, 13077, '<td valign="top">When I read the title I thought it was a photo of flu shots and I thought "wow, those are something I get a craving for about NEVER."<br/>Then I see it''s food. In black &amp; white.<br/>Meets the challenge and the rows of neatly stacked containers are appealing in a shopping sense, but it doesn''t strike me as a very compelling photo overall.</td>', 'When I read the title I thought it was a photo of flu shots and I thought "wow, those are something I get a craving for about NEVER."Then I see it''s food. In black & white.Meets the challenge and the rows of neatly stacked containers are appealing in a shopping sense, but it doesn''t strike me as a very compelling photo overall.', '2014-09-22 17:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265151, 1130190, 13077, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a good job making a bowl of cereal look good here. Maybe it''s the light, but if that''s milk it looks pretty watery.</td>', 'You''ve done a good job making a bowl of cereal look good here. Maybe it''s the light, but if that''s milk it looks pretty watery.', '2014-09-22 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265153, 1130238, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is that a bug? I don''t consider that to be food, but if you eat them more power to ya. Well composed photo and good texture to use black and white with, but there might have been a way to put more emphasis on the bug vs. the background.</td>', 'Is that a bug? I don''t consider that to be food, but if you eat them more power to ya. Well composed photo and good texture to use black and white with, but there might have been a way to put more emphasis on the bug vs. the background.', '2014-09-22 17:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265155, 1130307, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like you couldn''t wait to eat it until after you were done shooting it. lol</td>', 'Looks like you couldn''t wait to eat it until after you were done shooting it. lol', '2014-09-22 17:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265156, 1130293, 13077, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the hole in it doesn''t make it look very appetizing to me, and most of it seems soft.</td>', 'Sorry, but the hole in it doesn''t make it look very appetizing to me, and most of it seems soft.', '2014-09-22 17:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265158, 1130253, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement, and nicely done using the textures for contrast while using shades of gray in an old fashioned style of black and white.</td>', 'Good arrangement, and nicely done using the textures for contrast while using shades of gray in an old fashioned style of black and white.', '2014-09-22 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265160, 1130165, 13077, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t really make sense to me, and the photo has some motion blur. It does meet the challenge though, perhaps doubly so by using foods that are mostly black and white.</td>', 'The title doesn''t really make sense to me, and the photo has some motion blur. It does meet the challenge though, perhaps doubly so by using foods that are mostly black and white.', '2014-09-22 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265161, 1130129, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. Dramatic composition and lighting, attractive background although some more detail on the peach could probably have improved it. Still good overall though.</td>', 'Nice. Dramatic composition and lighting, attractive background although some more detail on the peach could probably have improved it. Still good overall though.', '2014-09-22 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265162, 1130210, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice - very interesting fruit, and well arranged with appropriate depth of field and good tones and exposure.</td>', 'Excellent choice - very interesting fruit, and well arranged with appropriate depth of field and good tones and exposure.', '2014-09-22 17:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265163, 1130173, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice set up and elements, cropped a bit wide for me</td>', 'Nice set up and elements, cropped a bit wide for me', '2014-09-22 17:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265164, 1130299, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - tough to make a steak look good without color but you''ve accomplished it here in my opinion. Good touch with the motion blur but keeping the spoon sharp, and the focus is perfectly placed.</td>', 'Nicely done - tough to make a steak look good without color but you''ve accomplished it here in my opinion. Good touch with the motion blur but keeping the spoon sharp, and the focus is perfectly placed.', '2014-09-22 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265165, 1130245, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! Oversharpened to my eye</td>', 'Fun idea! Oversharpened to my eye', '2014-09-22 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265166, 1130323, 96751, '<td valign="top">Funhouse feel to this image. don''t know where to look, but it''s so much fun!</td>', 'Funhouse feel to this image. don''t know where to look, but it''s so much fun!', '2014-09-22 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265167, 1130253, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the shapes and textures</td>', 'Love the shapes and textures', '2014-09-22 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265168, 1130044, 96751, '<td valign="top">Seems to have been taken with the on-camera flash. Not that there''s anything wrong with that :)</td>', 'Seems to have been taken with the on-camera flash. Not that there''s anything wrong with that :)', '2014-09-22 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265169, 1130190, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yummm! Soggy cereal!</td>', 'Yummm! Soggy cereal!', '2014-09-22 17:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265170, 1130293, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective!  Unusual for a reflection shot. Funny how the hole in the skin personifies the top pear!</td>', 'I love the perspective!  Unusual for a reflection shot. Funny how the hole in the skin personifies the top pear!', '2014-09-22 17:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265171, 1130286, 13077, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have included the edge of the tablecloth here. It gives the setting a kind of uneasiness like you might not feel comfortable sitting down there to eat.<br/> <br/>Also, a lit candle and some silverware might have complemented the subdued light/pasta-eating atmosphere you''ve got going. Maybe even some backlighting just for the glass bottles - they look great with backlighting. More so in color, but with the right tweaks that could help you even in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have included the edge of the tablecloth here. It gives the setting a kind of uneasiness like you might not feel comfortable sitting down there to eat. Also, a lit candle and some silverware might have complemented the subdued light/pasta-eating atmosphere you''ve got going. Maybe even some backlighting just for the glass bottles - they look great with backlighting. More so in color, but with the right tweaks that could help you even in B&W.', '2014-09-22 17:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265172, 1130177, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, did you forget to convert this to b/w?  But I do love rice pudding!!</td>', 'Hmmm, did you forget to convert this to b/w?  But I do love rice pudding!!', '2014-09-22 17:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265173, 1130262, 96751, '<td valign="top">I know the table is pretty level but everything else is slipping off the screen on the right!!!</td>', 'I know the table is pretty level but everything else is slipping off the screen on the right!!!', '2014-09-22 17:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265174, 1130250, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement, and the way the rows of translucent glasses show what''s behind them is very cool.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing this was shot in a cafe or deli so you might not have had much control over the lighting, but ordinarily glass would look better with more light if you can manage the reflections.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement, and the way the rows of translucent glasses show what''s behind them is very cool. I''m guessing this was shot in a cafe or deli so you might not have had much control over the lighting, but ordinarily glass would look better with more light if you can manage the reflections.', '2014-09-22 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265175, 1130142, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although a beautiful subject, the image tonal range could have been more dynamic. I also feel that this could have been more powerful with a square crop.</td>', 'Although a beautiful subject, the image tonal range could have been more dynamic. I also feel that this could have been more powerful with a square crop.', '2014-09-22 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265176, 1130294, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and bold shapes and shadows going everywhere.</td>', 'I like the tones and bold shapes and shadows going everywhere.', '2014-09-22 17:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265177, 1130176, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Great idea to place on the carpet. The leaf is perfectly placed. Very painterly, although I''d like to see just a teensy bit more detail lower right.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Great idea to place on the carpet. The leaf is perfectly placed. Very painterly, although I''d like to see just a teensy bit more detail lower right.', '2014-09-22 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265178, 1129959, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent still life. The ingredients reminds me of our resident Bear chef</td>', 'Excellent still life. The ingredients reminds me of our resident Bear chef', '2014-09-22 17:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265179, 1130222, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just sad.  Excellent photo but I have a hard time looking at it</td>', 'This is just sad.  Excellent photo but I have a hard time looking at it', '2014-09-22 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265180, 1130051, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the centermost spot in the image is empty...</td>', 'Interesting that the centermost spot in the image is empty...', '2014-09-22 17:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265181, 1130197, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like a department store of produce: ground floor bananas, next stop potatoes...</td>', 'Like a department store of produce: ground floor bananas, next stop potatoes...', '2014-09-22 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265183, 1130138, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this. Wonderful choice in pp''g. Modern art!</td>', 'I love this. Wonderful choice in pp''g. Modern art!', '2014-09-22 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265184, 1130307, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not getting it. But I do love that kinda donut</td>', 'Hmmm, not getting it. But I do love that kinda donut', '2014-09-22 17:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265185, 1130241, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of the more photogenic edibles out there.</td>', 'One of the more photogenic edibles out there.', '2014-09-22 17:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265186, 1130299, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur!</td>', 'I like the motion blur!', '2014-09-22 17:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265187, 1130121, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of Glamour Glow.</td>', 'Beautiful use of Glamour Glow.', '2014-09-22 17:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265188, 1130263, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the 3-Dness of this</td>', 'I like the 3-Dness of this', '2014-09-22 17:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265189, 1130322, 96751, '<td valign="top">Seems underlit, but a beautiful subject and pov</td>', 'Seems underlit, but a beautiful subject and pov', '2014-09-22 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265190, 1130205, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the dishes and the items on them.  The overhead perspective is very interesting as well. If your score is going to suffer at all it would be because of the odd choice of toning, which on my screen comes off quite greenish</td>', 'Love the dishes and the items on them.  The overhead perspective is very interesting as well. If your score is going to suffer at all it would be because of the odd choice of toning, which on my screen comes off quite greenish', '2014-09-22 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265191, 1130116, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setup, but the frontal lighting is killing those little jewels.  Something much more dramatic, and even slightly backlit would have made the translucent fish glow.</td>', 'Beautiful setup, but the frontal lighting is killing those little jewels.  Something much more dramatic, and even slightly backlit would have made the translucent fish glow.', '2014-09-22 17:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265193, 1130235, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gun, great use of shallow dof. I almost feel like one of the little square should jump up and tell me to get going.</td>', 'Gun, great use of shallow dof. I almost feel like one of the little square should jump up and tell me to get going.', '2014-09-22 17:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265195, 1130168, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yum. Beautiful and simple</td>', 'Yum. Beautiful and simple', '2014-09-22 17:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265196, 1130129, 96751, '<td valign="top">All I can think of is why are there speakers in the bg...</td>', 'All I can think of is why are there speakers in the bg...', '2014-09-22 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265197, 1130292, 96751, '<td valign="top">My kinda feast</td>', 'My kinda feast', '2014-09-22 17:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265198, 1130197, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement. Something about the composition and the photo seems like it could have been improved to make it more interesting, though.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement. Something about the composition and the photo seems like it could have been improved to make it more interesting, though.', '2014-09-22 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265199, 1130238, 96751, '<td valign="top">I guess he''s food for something...</td>', 'I guess he''s food for something...', '2014-09-22 17:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265200, 1130263, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Simple and appetizing, the B&amp;W might even work better than color in this case.</td>', 'Very well done. Simple and appetizing, the B&W might even work better than color in this case.', '2014-09-22 17:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265201, 1130300, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love these product multiples shots, but not sure about the inclusion of or the placement of the cart, off center.</td>', 'I love these product multiples shots, but not sure about the inclusion of or the placement of the cart, off center.', '2014-09-22 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265202, 1130234, 96751, '<td valign="top">Divine!  This might be my favorite of the challenge. So gracious and regal.</td>', 'Divine!  This might be my favorite of the challenge. So gracious and regal.', '2014-09-22 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265203, 1129928, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice high key</td>', 'Nice high key', '2014-09-22 17:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
