(7265252, 1130292, 68503, '<td valign="top">nice choice of foods to keep the tones not too far from their actual colors.</td>', 'nice choice of foods to keep the tones not too far from their actual colors.', '2014-09-22 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265253, 1130168, 68503, '<td valign="top">nice and simple, but I would be really hungry again after eating this :)</td>', 'nice and simple, but I would be really hungry again after eating this :)', '2014-09-22 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265256, 1130020, 68503, '<td valign="top">hmm another raw food picture :) I do like the added texture kind of gives it an older feeling. Just dont know if I agree with the subject for the entry. Be back later to vote</td>', 'hmm another raw food picture :) I do like the added texture kind of gives it an older feeling. Just dont know if I agree with the subject for the entry. Be back later to vote', '2014-09-22 23:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265258, 1130222, 68503, '<td valign="top">some people are probably dinging you on this because they think its cruel, but understandably this is the way it is done in some cultures, I like it even though I may have preferred to see rabbits being hung :)</td>', 'some people are probably dinging you on this because they think its cruel, but understandably this is the way it is done in some cultures, I like it even though I may have preferred to see rabbits being hung :)', '2014-09-22 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265262, 1130168, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition and good soft lighting.</td>', 'Nice simple composition and good soft lighting.', '2014-09-22 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265263, 1130173, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty. Good setting for the photo also.</td>', 'Looks tasty. Good setting for the photo also.', '2014-09-22 23:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265264, 1130241, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great detail and the shallow DOF makes it very attractive here, also well done keeping some detail in the light parts of the background.</td>', 'Great detail and the shallow DOF makes it very attractive here, also well done keeping some detail in the light parts of the background.', '2014-09-22 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265265, 1130318, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and sharpness on the stem, also I like that the background adds a nice pattern without being distracting.</td>', 'Excellent composition and sharpness on the stem, also I like that the background adds a nice pattern without being distracting.', '2014-09-22 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265266, 1130270, 13077, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that this is more appetizing in color - not sure what it is, but I can''t say the monochrome photo would make me want to try it. Also, a crop to remove the object near the top right would have helped, it''s not doing the photo any favors.</td>', 'I get the feeling that this is more appetizing in color - not sure what it is, but I can''t say the monochrome photo would make me want to try it. Also, a crop to remove the object near the top right would have helped, it''s not doing the photo any favors.', '2014-09-22 23:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265267, 1130142, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, unusual to see a tomato of all things in B&amp;W but they still look good - although the one at the top doesn''t look like a perfect specimen, maybe if it were rotated to have the odd shaped part on the other side it would look better?</td>', 'Nicely done, unusual to see a tomato of all things in B&W but they still look good - although the one at the top doesn''t look like a perfect specimen, maybe if it were rotated to have the odd shaped part on the other side it would look better?', '2014-09-22 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265268, 1130292, 13077, '<td valign="top">Mmm, looks good. I might have liked to see a little more detail in the shadows, if you could have processed it that way while still keeping the whites exactly as they are.</td>', 'Mmm, looks good. I might have liked to see a little more detail in the shadows, if you could have processed it that way while still keeping the whites exactly as they are.', '2014-09-22 23:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265269, 1130323, 13077, '<td valign="top">For sure - however I don''t think this food works very well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'For sure - however I don''t think this food works very well in B&W.', '2014-09-22 23:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265270, 1130111, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrayal, visually abstract already and the title just adds to it.</td>', 'Interesting portrayal, visually abstract already and the title just adds to it.', '2014-09-22 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265271, 1130322, 177322, '<td valign="top">Yep - two thumbs way up for me.  Most notable the various textures of the ear of corn  seem hyper-defined with your B&amp;W treatment: fat, round kernels; the fibrous husk; the tangle of the silk. Quite impressive.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep - two thumbs way up for me.  Most notable the various textures of the ear of corn  seem hyper-defined with your B&W treatment: fat, round kernels; the fibrous husk; the tangle of the silk. Quite impressive.  Good luck.', '2014-09-22 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265272, 1130116, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the variety, but I''m not crazy about the bright highlights. Maybe in the background, but if they were toned down in the food a bit it might have looked better.</td>', 'I like the variety, but I''m not crazy about the bright highlights. Maybe in the background, but if they were toned down in the food a bit it might have looked better.', '2014-09-23 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265273, 1130107, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely handled blacks tones and good lighting. I wonder if having the chocolates on a plate instead of the box might have looked a little more classy though?</td>', 'Nicely handled blacks tones and good lighting. I wonder if having the chocolates on a plate instead of the box might have looked a little more classy though?', '2014-09-23 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265274, 1130222, 177322, '<td valign="top">Eeeuuuw. Eeeuuuw. Eeeuuuw.  However, your B&amp;W interpretation introduces undeniable tonal range married to effective composition and sharp focus.  Gruesome, but a darn good photo technically.  Good luck</td>', 'Eeeuuuw. Eeeuuuw. Eeeuuuw.  However, your B&W interpretation introduces undeniable tonal range married to effective composition and sharp focus.  Gruesome, but a darn good photo technically.  Good luck', '2014-09-23 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265275, 1129959, 13077, '<td valign="top">Visually exciting array of foods and still simple enough composition overall. I might have included the rest of the knife handle though.</td>', 'Visually exciting array of foods and still simple enough composition overall. I might have included the rest of the knife handle though.', '2014-09-23 00:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265276, 1130194, 13077, '<td valign="top">Striking portrayal of the veggies, but between the contrast, the hard lighting and the chewed up fork it''s just too busy in my opinion.</td>', 'Striking portrayal of the veggies, but between the contrast, the hard lighting and the chewed up fork it''s just too busy in my opinion.', '2014-09-23 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265277, 1130263, 177322, '<td valign="top">Looks remarkably luscious sans color - excellent tonal range, nice sharp image, perfect composition. Wish you luck with this.</td>', 'Looks remarkably luscious sans color - excellent tonal range, nice sharp image, perfect composition. Wish you luck with this.', '2014-09-23 00:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265278, 1130302, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty, but it also looks underexposed. More lighting from another direction to assist the soft lighting already there might have helped - this could work very well in B&amp;W with the right lighting and processing.</td>', 'Looks tasty, but it also looks underexposed. More lighting from another direction to assist the soft lighting already there might have helped - this could work very well in B&W with the right lighting and processing.', '2014-09-23 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265279, 1129959, 177322, '<td valign="top">You may feed me anytime!  Good selection of foods with various textures and colors that make a very interesting B&amp;W image.  Your knowledge of food is as impressive as your photography skills.  Best of luck.</td>', 'You may feed me anytime!  Good selection of foods with various textures and colors that make a very interesting B&W image.  Your knowledge of food is as impressive as your photography skills.  Best of luck.', '2014-09-23 00:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265280, 1130304, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like there was just too much dynamic range for your sensor to capture it all - the light parts are blown out and the dark parts are lost. Other angles would have looked better as well - either top-down, or getting a lot closer and making some part of the meal or another the focus of the photo.</td>', 'Looks like there was just too much dynamic range for your sensor to capture it all - the light parts are blown out and the dark parts are lost. Other angles would have looked better as well - either top-down, or getting a lot closer and making some part of the meal or another the focus of the photo.', '2014-09-23 00:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265281, 1130234, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''ll bring the cranberry sauce &amp; green bean casserole! lol<br/>Excellent job capturing white feathers all the way to the dark neck with detail.</td>', 'I''ll bring the cranberry sauce & green bean casserole! lolExcellent job capturing white feathers all the way to the dark neck with detail.', '2014-09-23 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265282, 1130178, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yum. Nicely assembled, but if you cut most everything else why not the onion.</td>', 'Yum. Nicely assembled, but if you cut most everything else why not the onion.', '2014-09-23 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265283, 1130177, 13077, '<td valign="top">Can''t say that sounds like the tastiest snack to me, but maybe it''s an acquired taste. I think the lighting on this could have been approved, and has it actually been converted to B&amp;W?<br/> <br/>edit - I meant to say improved not approved - typed that at work and approved is a much more common word for me to use in work emails ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-29 22:29:13.</i></td>', 'Can''t say that sounds like the tastiest snack to me, but maybe it''s an acquired taste. I think the lighting on this could have been approved, and has it actually been converted to B&W? edit - I meant to say improved not approved - typed that at work and approved is a much more common word for me to use in work emails ;)', '2014-09-23 00:12:54.000000', '2014-09-29 23:29:13.000000', 1),
(7265284, 1130227, 13077, '<td valign="top">That''s a big spork.</td>', 'That''s a big spork.', '2014-09-23 00:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265285, 1130291, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I can''t tell if I like the angle of the plate, or the added texture. After looking at it for a while I''m not crazy about either, honestly.</td>', 'Interesting - I can''t tell if I like the angle of the plate, or the added texture. After looking at it for a while I''m not crazy about either, honestly.', '2014-09-23 00:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265286, 1130044, 13077, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this didn''t do you any favors, and the background doesn''t help much. Usually shooting eggs in water or resting on some kind of textured surface would look better than a glass bowl, and plastic plants never look very good close up.<br/> <br/>The shape and faint texture of eggs could be very good for a B&amp;W food photo, but only when lit softly and evenly overall.</td>', 'The lighting on this didn''t do you any favors, and the background doesn''t help much. Usually shooting eggs in water or resting on some kind of textured surface would look better than a glass bowl, and plastic plants never look very good close up. The shape and faint texture of eggs could be very good for a B&W food photo, but only when lit softly and evenly overall.', '2014-09-23 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265287, 1130313, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured details and good light angle for the strands, but the composition could probably have been improved. Also some fill light on the dark side couldn''t have hurt - a white posterboard or piece of paper would probably do the trick well enough, failing that some aluminum foil or an actual reflector or light.</td>', 'Nicely captured details and good light angle for the strands, but the composition could probably have been improved. Also some fill light on the dark side couldn''t have hurt - a white posterboard or piece of paper would probably do the trick well enough, failing that some aluminum foil or an actual reflector or light.', '2014-09-23 00:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265288, 1130249, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed - simple still life, meets the challenge well</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed - simple still life, meets the challenge well', '2014-09-23 00:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7265289, 1130262, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice looking bread, but the angle you shot it from could have been improved. I would have gotten lower and closer to the bread and framed more with the basket and white flowers than the other stuff</td>', 'Nice looking bread, but the angle you shot it from could have been improved. I would have gotten lower and closer to the bread and framed more with the basket and white flowers than the other stuff', '2014-09-23 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
